fd2779d","name":"Screenshot_20261016_204206_Instagram.jpg","state":"dismissed","dismissed":true,"style_only":false,"routed":false,"piece_id":null,"his_words":{"why_here":"I love this because the headline makes you want to know more but the topic is actually about AI ethics, which is, on paper, one of the most boring topics out there. I think that I'm quite a powerful capability to turn boring topics into something really entertaining. As we evolve the Make Your Mind Up Instagram, X, and YouTube channels, I was thinking that we could pump out carousels kind of like this in my branding.","why_like":null,"would_do":null},"words_at":"2026-10-24T08:38:10.183+00:00","heard":null,"url":null},{"id":"5b865aa9-463c-44c3-9352-73fda39fa18e","name":"Screenshot_20261017_055750_Instagram.jpg","state":"dismissed","dismissed":true,"style_only":false,"routed":false,"piece_id":null,"his_words":{"why_here":"Could be useful for us making visuals but it also could just be useful to quote in a piece in the near future.","why_like":null,"would_do":null},"words_at":"2026-10-24T08:36:55.623+00:00","heard":null,"url":null},{"id":"45e0ead0-310b-4c74-9bd2-54305fb41539","name":"SaveClip.App_AQP6P-DCy7NO_pjNElKDguG_v7k6eDrPLbpSrLvvT_GvZqgKE7uRcpc5VXFzMOQWFweCOjXoGXxg1nPYaOc3FiiPLJDNalps77vPHVo.mp4","state":"style_only","dismissed":false,"style_only":true,"routed":false,"piece_id":null,"his_words":{"why_here":null,"why_like":"This video needs to be watched frame by frame because it's an explainer on how Anthropic and GitHub are interacting and how Anthropic's building a new version of GitHub. I tend to talk about more business-related changes so the topic itself is less relevant even though it is about AI. I'm more showing you that I like the visual style. I like how the visuals support most of the absorption of information and with a powerful voiceover this could be a really nice format for certain topics where appropriate.","would_do":null},"words_at":"2026-10-24T08:36:04.713+00:00","heard":"Anthropic just replaced Git. Yes, Git. The thing practically every developer uses to manage code. And the reason is fascinating. Anthropic says its own development activity grew so fast that Git became its biggest bottleneck. In May, Anthropic was merging about 2,500 code change…","url":null},{"id":"385a5da8-2cae-41ec-8fb6-2e328920664c","name":"09 Reading is free. Sending needs a yes.","state":"routed","dismissed":false,"style_only":false,"routed":true,"piece_id":null,"his_words":{"why_here":"It's just good general advice for other topics that are more interesting than this.","why_like":null,"would_do":null},"words_at":"2026-10-24T06:17:11.161+00:00","heard":null,"url":null}],"recent":[{"id":"4f8f23b2-8cb2-4498-b07c-243840f8a1ba","idea":"So what: Your staff and customers will soon be building small tools without knowing it, because ChatGPT and Claude now answer ordinary questions with a working calculator or chart instead of a paragraph, and nobody checks the maths behind those tools. Story: Since 8 Oct 2026, ChatGPT's Intelligent UI can answer a free user's question with a bill splitter, a calculator, a form or a map built on the spot, and Claude's custom visuals have been on for every user on web and desktop since spring with ","state":"drafting","scheduled_for":"2026-11-27","series":"mind_the_gap","covers":["626b338c-c064-4743-bf1c-22981f54d3e1"]},{"id":"388c764e-318d-4225-a931-d117a47f13ad","idea":"Jack Clark told the IMF the singularity has begun. The benchmark data he used is the part nobody is writing about.","state":"drafting","scheduled_for":"2026-11-27","series":"mind_the_gap","covers":["772d09a7-2455-4f05-a6f2-d90d0e60314a"]},{"id":"bf0fddae-2fcf-4687-9079-190729234ed3","idea":"Canva, Adobe or Claude: who owns design in 2028? At Adobe MAX on 10 Nov, Adobe made Firefly an AI creative studio, put agents in Illustrator, Premiere and InDesign, and opened its desktop apps to other companies' agents. Claude Design lists both Canva and Adobe as connectors, and Anthropic says over a million people used it in its first week. The fight is over who the other AIs send work to. So what: The design tools your team pays for are turning into agents that work for each other: before ren","state":"drafting","scheduled_for":"2026-11-25","series":"under_the_hood","covers":["50368dee-0a10-4452-a79a-0607d4f2e278"]},{"id":"8287846b-6618-4a19-9fb8-23ad4eca2718","idea":"Oracle files to sell $20B in new stock, bonds to finance AI buildout","state":"drafting","scheduled_for":"2026-11-23","series":"follow_the_money","covers":[]},{"id":"b019dbf8-8051-4cab-9b5e-2ad77b3f5118","idea":"Where does AI get built when towns say no?","state":"drafting","scheduled_for":"2026-11-20","series":"mind_the_gap","covers":[]},{"id":"c00cd4e0-e1bb-4c60-b36f-cea92897e38c","idea":"Will your AI auditor find your missing money, or the skeletons in your closet?","state":"drafting","scheduled_for":"2026-11-20","series":"mind_the_gap","covers":[]},{"id":"701a2c55-7400-4dc8-99cb-d6001147ae16","idea":"Which of your habits will cost you your job once AI is at work?","state":"drafting","scheduled_for":"2026-11-19","series":"mind_the_gap","covers":[]},{"id":"db9f9f6a-1092-49be-8024-f335e060305a","idea":"The labs writing everyone's code still run Salesforce","state":"drafting","scheduled_for":"2026-11-18","series":"under_the_hood","covers":["6eaaf127-ed4e-48bc-86a0-54c9e99aa428"]},{"id":"f3fcd5e1-573e-4692-a413-db7c5823a10e","idea":"Meta staff were ranked by AI use. They gamed it.","state":"published","scheduled_for":"2026-11-13","series":"mind_the_gap","covers":[]},{"id":"36886e0b-4b32-473b-be72-b0aef31fccef","idea":"AI is already inside the songs people have on repeat, hidden in the credits. Movin' To The Sun started as a Suno demo, was rebuilt by HUGEL with a new Ultra Naté vocal and reached No. 2 in the UK. Bad Times was re-sung by a human singer and licensed to Universal. The Grammys have now ruled the same ","state":"published","scheduled_for":"2026-11-11","series":"under_t