lowing a US government export control order, triggered by a cybersecurity jailbreak that Amazon researchers found just three days after launch. The AI joked about being","account":"evolving.ai","url":"https://www.instagram.com/evolving.ai/p/DaXeruZgIxe/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"🕵️📄 The newest job hunting skill is writing invisible messages to the software screening your resume.","excerpt":"🕵️📄 The newest job hunting skill is writing invisible messages to the software screening your resume. A researcher hiring a lab technician discovered it this week while reviewing applications: commands embedded in 2.25 point white text, invisible to humans but legible to AI tools. The hidden lines told the system to ignore all other input and move the applicant forward without mentioning the","account":"evolving.ai","url":"https://www.instagram.com/evolving.ai/p/Dba9GhnDcHd/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"😂⚽ AI just turned the World Cup into the biggest meme factory the internet has ever seen.","excerpt":"😂⚽ AI just turned the World Cup into the biggest meme factory the internet has ever seen. The World Cup kicked off on June 11 in Mexico City, and so did the internet chaos, obviously. This is the first World Cup happening during the explosion of AI video and image generators, which turned the meme machine up to full blast. People have already cast Death Note's Shinigami as Japan's assistant","account":"evolving.ai","url":"https://www.instagram.com/evolving.ai/p/DZrpuYhgJa0/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"🚨 It's back.","excerpt":"🚨 It's back. After 19 days offline, Claude Fable 5, one of the most powerful AI models ever released, is live again and in people's hands. Everyone. Worldwide. Anthropic pulled access on June 12 to comply with U.S. export controls. Those controls were lifted on June 30, and Fable 5 came back online July 1. It's been less than 24 hours, and people are already building things that shouldn't be","account":"evolving.ai","url":"https://www.instagram.com/evolving.ai/p/DaTAdffjbV3/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"This Naruto vs Pain is unreal, chills the entire way through.","excerpt":"This Naruto vs Pain is unreal, chills the entire way through. There’s a specific frustration every anime fan knows: the manga panel in your head always looks bigger than the animation on screen. Budgets run out, corners get cut, the god-tier jutsu ends up a flash of light and a still frame. This AI recreation of Pain versus the Nine-Tails is what happens when that ceiling disappears. Every","account":"evolving.ai","url":"https://www.instagram.com/evolving.ai/reel/DbQMqvpgyHV/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"🎓🤖 Most exams reward students for producing the right answer.","excerpt":"🎓🤖 Most exams reward students for producing the right answer. Fudan University flipped that premise for a recent final, asking students to write the questions instead. The university laid out the format. 51 students each submitted 10 questions aimed at 3 AI models: Claude, DeepSeek, and MiniMax. The task was not to answer anything. It was to write prompts precise enough to make the models fail,","account":"evolving.ai","url":"https://www.instagram.com/evolving.ai/p/DadFuMQgK8u/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"AI is a tool.","excerpt":"AI is a tool. Only business owners know how to properly utilize that tool can grow their business effectively. And when I say \"utilize\" I don't mean relying on AI to do everything for you. AI can't replicate your brand, your mind, and your personality so make sure you know how to bring that to your marketing. Follow for more hot takes!","account":"sebastianhardy_","url":"https://www.instagram.com/sebastianhardy_/p/DQ1N4uYDOJW/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"🤖🎮 Claude Fable 5 just helped one developer build a full multiplayer World of Warcraft style MMO, and it actually runs.","excerpt":"🤖🎮 Claude Fable 5 just helped one developer build a full multiplayer World of Warcraft style MMO, and it actually runs. The project, called World of Claudecraft, is modeled closely on classic World of Warcraft. The creator says most of it was generated through an approach known as vibe coding, where code is produced by describing what the software should do rather than writing it by hand. It runs","account":"evolving.ai","url":"https://www.instagram.com/evolving.ai/p/DZj_x-1AFZ7/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"🎯 This guy just built a zero-delay auto-aim system on an $8 microcontroller A creator loaded a person detection model directly onto an ESP32, a microcontroller that costs less tha","excerpt":"🎯 This guy just built a zero-delay auto-aim system on an $8 microcontroller A creator loaded a person detection model directly onto an ESP32, a microcontroller that costs less than lunch, and got it tracking human movement on device. No cloud call, no server round trip, no rented GPU. Everything runs on the chip itself, which is why the response feels immediate. He says the next step is wiring it","account":"evolving.ai","url":"https://www.instagram.com/evolving.ai/p/DbgNp0NjcGY/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"🤖✏️ A new GPT Image 2 prompt going around asks one of the most advanced image models to produce the worst possible output, and it works every time.","excerpt":"🤖✏️ A new GPT Image 2 prompt going around asks one of the most advanced image models to produce the worst possible output, and it works every time. It tells the model to redraw photos as if scribbled in MS Paint with a mouse. The full prompt: \"Redraw the attached image in the most clumsy, scribbly, and utterly pathetic way possible. Use a white background, and make it look like it was drawn in MS","account":"evolving.ai","url":"https://www.instagram.com/evolving.ai/p/DXzXvyejYaq/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"Ronaldo just had a rough World Cup opener and the whole internet 