etting rich in the AI era.","excerpt":"🤖💰 The man who ran Google for a decade just gave the clearest playbook yet for getting rich in the AI era. Speaking at the Imagination In Action AI Summit in Davos alongside Deloitte Global CEO Joe Ucuzoglu and billionaire David Rubenstein, Schmidt argued that the clearest path to wealth in this cycle is building an AI agent that actually does something, not just designing agents in theory. He","account":"evolving.ai","url":"https://www.instagram.com/evolving.ai/p/DXwqFWWCAQS/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"Sam Altman posted a ChatGPT use case for parents on Friday, and the replies absolutely backfired heavily.","excerpt":"Sam Altman posted a ChatGPT use case for parents on Friday, and the replies absolutely backfired heavily. The idea was aimed at ChatGPT Work, the agent OpenAI launched on July 9 that connects to apps and files and finishes multi step tasks. Altman said parents could connect their family calendars, add their children's interests, and have the system generate a podcast for the morning drive to","account":"evolving.ai","url":"https://www.instagram.com/evolving.ai/p/DbksUiOAAsR/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"Every so often a match turns into a story bigger than the scoreline, and this was one of them.","excerpt":"Every so often a match turns into a story bigger than the scoreline, and this was one of them. A nation of half a million people, in their first-ever World Cup, took the defending champions to extra time and came within minutes of the biggest shock the tournament has ever seen. The video frames it perfectly: Messi as the unbeatable final boss in a dark suit, Cape Verde as the exhausted heroes the","account":"evolving.ai","url":"https://www.instagram.com/evolving.ai/reel/DaXGN3YzaVH/","at":"2026-11-17T05:17:46.825+00:00"},{"title":"The Immortal Realm: A Chinese Vision of Paradise Chinese creators are using AI to blend ancient mythology with futuristic architecture, cre